  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "class_f_05_dragon_01",
      "hash64": "5A9FE3AEC3AD22D0",
      "text": "Hola, clase.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "class_f_05_dragon_02",
      "hash64": "5A9FE6AEC3AD27E9",
      "text": "Os comunico que habéis aprobado todos el\\nexamen parcial sin el menor problema.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "class_f_05_dragon_03",
      "hash64": "5A9FE5AEC3AD2636",
      "text": "Y, como premio por vuestros esfuerzos, hoy os\\ntraigo a un invitado de excepción.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "class_f_05_dragon_04",
      "hash64": "5A9FE8AEC3AD2B4F",
      "text": "Adelante, Brais. ¡El estrado es tuyo![VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "class_f_05_kusa_01",
      "hash64": "68E2B514A1C72785",
      "text": "¡Hola a todos![VAR 0x0114(002C)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002C"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "class_f_05_kusa_02",
      "hash64": "68E2B214A1C7226C",
      "text": "Me llamo Brais, y soy un artista especializado en\\nPokémon de tipo Planta.[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "class_f_05_dragon_05",
      "hash64": "5A9FE7AEC3AD299C",
      "text": "Brais se dedica principalmente a la creación de\\nobras tridimensionales, como las esculturas.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "class_f_05_dragon_06",
      "hash64": "5A9FEAAEC3AD2EB5",
      "text": "Una de sus obras más afamadas se expone en\\nPueblo Altamía, y lleva por título \"La indolencia\\r\\nde Sunflora\".[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 109,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "class_f_05_dragon_07",
      "hash64": "5A9FE9AEC3AD2D02",
      "text": "Quienes hayáis afrontado ya el Gimnasio de\\nPueblo Altamía la reconoceréis sin duda.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "class_f_05_kusa_03",
      "hash64": "68E2B314A1C7241F",
      "text": "Sí, veo algunas caras conocidas por aquí.[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 41,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "class_f_05_kusa_04",
      "hash64": "68E2B014A1C71F06",
      "text": "No sabéis la suerte tan inmensa que tenéis de\\nasistir a las clases de Hesperio.[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "class_f_05_kusa_05",
      "hash64": "68E2B114A1C720B9",
      "text": "Hace tiempo atravesé una etapa muy oscura\\nen mi vida. Había perdido la esperanza y la\\r\\nmotivación para seguir adelante...[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 123,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "class_f_05_kusa_06",
      "hash64": "68E2AE14A1C71BA0",
      "text": "Y allí estuvo él para tenderme la mano y\\nrescatarme de aquel mísero agujero.\\c\\nPara mí es más que un simple profesor, es...\\nun referente y un maestro de la vida.[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 162,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "class_f_05_kusa_07",
      "hash64": "68E2AF14A1C71D53",
      "text": "Fue gracias a él que pude afianzar mi estilo\\nactual.[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 52,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "class_f_05_dragon_08",
      "hash64": "5A9FECAEC3AD321B",
      "text": "Brais...[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "class_f_05_dragon_09",
      "hash64": "5A9FEBAEC3AD3068",
      "text": "Nada malo hay en recordar viejas batallas, pero\\nhoy querría que dieras a mis alumnos una lección\\r\\ncomo solo tú sabes hacerlo.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 127,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "class_f_05_kusa_08",
      "hash64": "68E2BC14A1C7336A",
      "text": "¡Desde luego! ¡Eso está hecho![VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "class_f_05_kusa_09",
      "hash64": "68E2BD14A1C7351D",
      "text": "Veamos... Hablemos de mi obra, \"La indolencia\\nde Sunflora\", que ha mencionado mi buen amigo.[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "class_f_05_kusa_10",
      "hash64": "68E63A14A1CA3F5B",
      "text": "¿Quién sabría decirme cuál era mi estado de\\nánimo cuando tallé ese semblante inexpresivo y\\r\\nesa mirada perdida en el infinito?[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 128,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "class_f_05_select_01",
      "hash64": "1738F3B775F84FC1",
      "text": "Felicidad",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "class_f_05_select_02",
      "hash64": "1738F0B775F84AA8",
      "text": "Tristeza",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "class_f_05_select_03",
      "hash64": "1738F1B775F84C5B",
      "text": "Rabia",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "class_f_05_kusa_11",
      "hash64": "68E63914A1CA3DA8",
      "text": "¡Mal, mal, mal y mil veces mal![VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "class_f_05_kusa_12",
      "hash64": "68E63C14A1CA42C1",
      "text": "Cuando la tallé, venía de una época en la que\\nestaba sumido en un abismo de desesperanza.[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "class_f_05_kusa_13",
      "hash64": "68E63B14A1CA410E",
      "text": "Había decidido retirarme si mi arte no obtenía\\nreconocimiento. ¡Todo me daba igual![VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "class_f_05_dragon_10",
      "hash64": "5A9C7EAEC3AA415A",
      "text": "¿Y de ahí que la bautizaras así?[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "class_f_05_kusa_14",
      "hash64": "68E63E14A1CA4627",
      "text": "¡Efectivamente, Hesperio![VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "class_f_05_kusa_15",
      "hash64": "68E63D14A1CA4474",
      "text": "En los inicios de mi carrera como artista, caí\\ngravemente enfermo.\\c\\nPostrado y desahuciado... Sentí haber tocado\\nfondo.[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 121,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "class_f_05_kusa_16",
      "hash64": "68E64014A1CA498D",
      "text": "Mi único propósito era que mi obra se vendiese.\\nSolo me importaban el dinero y la fama.[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "class_f_05_kusa_17",
      "hash64": "68E63F14A1CA47DA",
      "text": "Y todo cuanto logré crear fueron piezas sin alma,\\npropias de un pintor de brocha gorda. ¡Basura![VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "class_f_05_kusa_18",
      "hash64": "68E63214A1CA31C3",
      "text": "Entonces conocí a Hesperio. Él me hizo ver la\\npresunción que teñía mi mediocridad.\\c\\nY así fue como pude abandonar mi pozo de\\nmiseria y dejarlo atrás para siempre.[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 164,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "class_f_05_kusa_19",
      "hash64": "68E63114A1CA3010",
      "text": "Fue justo entonces cuando esculpí a Sunflora.[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "class_f_05_dragon_11",
      "hash64": "5A9C7FAEC3AA430D",
      "text": "Asombroso... Ni siquiera yo conocía la historia\\níntegra.[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 56,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "class_f_05_kusa_20",
      "hash64": "68DBA814A1C0F2C0",
      "text": "Con frecuencia, es a los más allegados a quienes\\nmás cuesta abrirse.[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "class_f_05_kusa_21",
      "hash64": "68DBA914A1C0F473",
      "text": "Estoy seguro de que tenéis la cabeza y el\\ncorazón rebosantes de preocupaciones.\\c\\nAl fin y al cabo, sois adolescentes y es algo\\npropio de vuestra edad.[VAR 0x0114(0017)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 152,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "class_f_05_kusa_22",
      "hash64": "68DBAA14A1C0F626",
